    <string name="finger_note">Swipe along the sensor, double or triple tap it, or rest a finger on it for a second, and choose what each one does. Switch mode goes through the swipe modes that are on, in their order; the phone wakes in the first. With a triple tap set, a double tap waits half a second for the third. In Keymapper mode a swipe up presses F13 and a swipe down F14, once per swipe; record them as a trigger in Keymapper. It only works while the phone is unlocked; on the lock screen the sensor unlocks as usual.</string>
